sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 1: First-Time Visitor Landing & Anonymous Session Initialization

  actor User as Candidate Browser
  participant Edge as Vercel Edge / CDN
  participant Web as React 18 SPA (web/src)
  participant LocalStore as Browser LocalStorage
  participant API as Node.js API (Render / localhost)

  User->>Edge: GET / (https://curevo.dpdns.org)
  Edge-->>User: 200 OK (index.html, JS/CSS bundles)
  User->>Web: main.tsx bootstraps React 18 Root
  Web->>Web: initGlobalErrorMonitoring() hooks window.onerror & unhandledrejection
  Web->>LocalStore: Check draft storage probe (__curevo_storage_probe__)
  Web->>API: GET /api/ai/status (rateLimit: 120/min)
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { enabled: true, provider: "AI Engine", model: "AI Engine", maxIterations: 2 }
  User->>Web: Clicks "Launch Free CV Builder" or navigates to /builder
  Web->>LocalStore: loadDraft(null) queries "curevo_builder_draft_v1_anonymous"
  LocalStore-->>Web: null (No prior draft found)
  Web->>Web: Sets step = 'idle', mode = 'improve', creates blank in-memory session
  Web-->>User: Renders PublicBuilder view with 3 modes (Improve, Create, ATS)

---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 2: Resume Document Upload, Ingestion, AI Improvement & Truth Guard Verification

  actor User as Candidate
  participant Web as PublicBuilder.tsx
  participant API as Express Router (/api/public)
  participant Multer as RAM Buffer (Multer)
  participant Worker as Node.js Isolated Worker Thread
  participant ATS as Deterministic ATS Engine
  participant LLM as NVIDIA Nemotron AI
  participant TG as Truth Guard Interceptor
  participant Storage as LocalStorage

  User->>Web: Drops file (resume.pdf / resume.docx, <=8MB)
  Web->>Web: Validates extension (.pdf, .docx, .txt) & file size (<8MB)
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/parse (multipart FormData)
  API->>Multer: Stores in memory buffer (multer.memoryStorage())
  
  alt File is PDF
    API->>Worker: parsePdfInWorker(buffer) with 15s timeout
    Worker->>Worker: pdfjs-dist extracts text items, detects 2-column gutters
    Worker-->>API: Extracted lines array & layout structure
  else File is DOCX
    API->>API: zipGuard.ts inspects Central Directory (Zip-bomb & entry bounds)
    API->>Worker: parseDocxInWorker(buffer) with 15s timeout
    Worker->>Worker: mammoth.convertToHtml extracts raw paragraphs & headings
    Worker-->>API: Extracted lines array
  end

  API->>API: Deterministic extraction (contact info, sections, dates, bullets, skills)
  API->>ATS: analyseATS(resume) computes 5 standard dimensions
  ATS-->>API: Overall score (e.g. 64/100) + check breakdowns
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { resume, ats, audit, confidence, notes }
  Web->>Web: Populates editor state, displays before ATS score

  User->>Web: Clicks "Improve Resume with AI Engine" (Optionally inputs target role / JD)
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/improve { resume, targetRole, jobText }
  API->>API: aiConcurrencyGuard checks global (<5) and IP (<1) limits
  API->>LLM: POST chat/completions (nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b, reasoning_effort: 'medium')
  LLM-->>API: JSON payload with rewritten Google XYZ bullets
  API->>TG: tailorResume() executes Truth Guard Validation
  
  TG->>TG: calculateIntervalUnionYears(master) = 5.2 yrs
  TG->>TG: Verify claimed duration <= 5.2 yrs (Rejects fabricated 12 years)
  TG->>TG: Verify numbers against masterNumbers multiset (Allows <= bounds, flags hallucinated $)
  TG->>TG: Verify leadership headcount against getSupportedHeadcount()
  
  alt Truth Guard passes
    TG-->>API: Accepted tailored bullets
  else Fact fabrication or hallucination detected
    TG->>TG: Reverts affected bullets to verified Master CV source bullets
    TG-->>API: Sanitized bullets + changeLog recording rejected claims
  end

  API->>ATS: Deterministic re-verification (atsAfter)
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { resume, atsBefore, atsAfter, changeLog, truth, agent }
  Web->>Storage: Debounced autosave (1200ms) to "curevo_builder_draft_v1_anonymous"
  Web-->>User: Displays improved CV, diff changelog, and updated ATS score ring

