sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 3: Cold Resume Creation from Scratch

  actor User as Candidate
  participant Web as PublicBuilder.tsx (Mode: Create)
  participant Editor as ResumeFormEditor.tsx
  participant Coach as Client Writing Coach (writingCoach.ts)
  participant API as Express Router (/api/public)
  participant Storage as LocalStorage

  User->>Web: Selects "Create from Scratch" (/builder?mode=create)
  Web->>Editor: Renders blank structured CV form sections
  User->>Editor: Enters contact info, work experiences, skills
  User->>Editor: Types bullet: "Worked on website performance"
  Editor->>Coach: analyseBulletLocal("Worked on website performance")
  Coach-->>Editor: Flags weak opener "Worked on", suggests power verb ("Architected", "Accelerated"), prompts for metric
  User->>Editor: Edits bullet: "Accelerated API response times by 40% via Redis caching"
  Coach-->>Editor: Green checkmark (Google XYZ formula satisfied: Action + Impact + Method)
  User->>Web: Clicks "Generate Structured Resume"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/create { createForm, targetRole }
  API->>API: Sanitizes fields, applies standard section hierarchy
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { resume, ats, match, changeLog, truth }
  Web->>Storage: Autosaves to "curevo_builder_draft_v1_anonymous"
  Web-->>User: Displays complete CV in live vector preview with template selector

