sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 4: Target Job Description Matching & Truth-Grounded Tailoring

  actor User as Candidate
  participant Web as PublicBuilder.tsx (Tab: Match / Tailor)
  participant API as Express Router (/api/public)
  participant JD as JD Engine (jd.ts)
  participant Match as Match Engine (match.ts)
  participant LLM as NVIDIA Nemotron AI
  participant TG as Truth Guard Interceptor

  User->>Web: Pastes target job description text into match panel
  User->>Web: Clicks "Analyze Match & Gaps"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/match { resume: activeResume, jobText }
  API->>JD: analyseJobDescription(jobText)
  JD->>JD: Extracts title, seniority, required skills, preferred skills, domain terms
  JD-->>API: Structured JobAnalysis
  API->>Match: computeJobMatch(resume, jobAnalysis)
  Match->>Match: Computes 7 weighted components (35% required, 15% resp, 15% exp, etc.)
  Match->>Match: Assigns EvidenceProvenance (source_cv vs unsupported)
  Match-->>API: MatchAnalysis { score: 72, matchedSkills, missingSkills, advisory }
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { job, match }
  Web-->>User: Displays Match Ring (72%), matched skills pills, and candidate evidence prompt

  opt Candidate Attestation (Addressing Missing Skills)
    User->>Web: Attests missing skill "Docker" with verified bullet proof
    Web->>Web: Appends attested entry to resume data
  end

  User->>Web: Clicks "Tailor Resume for Role"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/improve { resume, jobText, targetRole }
  API->>LLM: Tailoring prompt with strict Truth Guard constraints
  LLM-->>API: Generated candidate draft
  API->>TG: Audit candidate draft against original Master CV facts
  TG->>TG: Reverts any unsupported skills or inflated durations to Master CV baseline
  TG-->>API: Verified tailored resume + truth audit report
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { resume: tailoredResume, matchAfter: 91, truth }
  Web-->>User: Displays tailored CV ready for export

