sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 5: Tailored Cover Letter Synthesis & PDF Download

  actor User as Candidate
  participant Web as PublicBuilder.tsx (Tab: Cover Letter)
  participant API as Express Router (/api/public)
  participant LLM as NVIDIA Nemotron AI
  participant TG as Truth Guard (sanitiseParagraph)
  participant PDF as PDFKit Streaming Engine

  User->>Web: Enters company name, target role, selects tone ("confident")
  User->>Web: Clicks "Generate Cover Letter"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/cover-letter { resume, jobDescription, targetRole, company, tone }
  API->>API: Validates CV facts exist (>=1 experience, >=1 skill)
  API->>LLM: Prompts Nemotron with candidate facts + company context
  LLM-->>API: 3-4 structured letter paragraphs
  API->>TG: sanitiseParagraph() checks each paragraph for unsupported claims
  TG-->>API: Sanitized letter text + rejectedCount
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { letter, targetRole, company, rejectedCount, isFallback: false }
  Web-->>User: Renders editable cover letter in browser

  User->>Web: Clicks "Download Cover Letter PDF"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/cover-letter/pdf { letter, candidateName, role, company, pageSize: "A4" }
  API->>PDF: renderCoverLetterPdf() generates single-column PDFKit stream
  PDF-->>API: Readable binary stream
  API-->>Web: 200 OK (Content-Type: application/pdf, Content-Disposition: attachment)
  Web->>Web: window.URL.createObjectURL(blob), clicks hidden anchor, revokes URL
  Web-->>User: Browser downloads "Candidate_Name_Cover_Letter.pdf"

