sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Journey 8: AI Interview Preparation & Voice-Enabled Mock Interview Simulation

  actor User as Candidate
  participant Web as Interview.tsx (/interview)
  participant Speech as Web Speech API (Browser Hardware)
  participant API as Express Router (/api/public/interview)
  participant LLM as NVIDIA Nemotron AI
  participant Storage as LocalStorage

  User->>Web: Enters role "Staff Backend Engineer", company "Stripe", selects difficulty "Senior"
  User->>Web: Clicks "Generate Interview Pack"
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/interview/prep { role, company, difficulty: "senior", resume }
  API->>LLM: Synthesizes technical, behavioral, situational questions + 7-day study plan
  LLM-->>API: Question pack JSON
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { questions: [...], studyPlan: [...] }
  Web-->>User: Renders categorized questions with sample answers & study plan

  User->>Web: Switches to "Mock Interview" tab, selects 3 questions, clicks "Start Simulation"
  Web->>Speech: speakQuestion(firstQuestion.text)
  Speech-->>User: Reads question aloud through device speakers via window.speechSynthesis
  
  User->>Web: Clicks microphone icon to answer
  Web->>Speech: VoiceTranscriber starts SpeechRecognition (webkitSpeechRecognition)
  User->>Speech: Speaks answer into device microphone
  Speech-->>Web: Emits real-time transcribed text tokens into answer field
  User->>Web: Clicks "Submit Answer"
  
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/interview/mock-evaluate { question, answer, role }
  API->>LLM: Evaluates against STAR rubric, clarity, impact, and Truth Guard
  LLM-->>API: Feedback, score dimensions, and adaptive follow-up question
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { evaluation: { score: 85, feedback, nextQuestion } }
  Web-->>User: Displays feedback, scores, and transitions to question 2

  User->>Web: Completes all 3 questions
  Web->>API: POST /api/public/interview/mock-final { transcript }
  API->>LLM: Generates final competency breakdown report
  LLM-->>API: Final report JSON
  API-->>Web: 200 OK { overallScore: 88, categoryBreakdown, actionItems }
  Web->>Storage: saveInterviewSession() persists transcript to "curevo_interview_sessions_v1"
  Web-->>User: Displays comprehensive final performance report

